---
title: Job State Diagram
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> not_started : Job submitted
    not_started --> assigned : Worker assigned (GetJob)
    assigned --> scheduled : Worker confirmed (ConfirmJobReceived)
    scheduled --> started : Worker began execution (ReportJobStarted)
    started --> completed : Execution successful
    started --> failed : Execution error
    assigned --> failed : Worker crash (recovery)

    completed --> [*]
    failed --> [*]

    note right of not_started
        Job in queue awaiting
        worker assignment
    end note

    note right of assigned
        Worker has been assigned
        but not yet confirmed
    end note

    note right of started
        Executor process running
        with cgroup isolation
    end note
